This project is licensed under two non-commercial licenses:

1. Software / code – PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0
   (SPDX: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0, full text: LICENSE-CODE.md,
   https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0/)
   Covers:
